// stackFrameInfoFramePrototype, and what only it reaches
//
// The prototype of the frame the debugging natives answer for one
// interpreter stack frame (src/frames/DebugAPI.cpp clones it): the code
// block running, the program counter in it, the receiver and the context
// frame.

stackFrameInfoFramePrototype := {class: 'StackFrameInfoFrame, CodeBlock: nil, programCounter: nil, receiver: nil, contextFrame: nil};
